From 8752511f0d645acaf6270279edd499ba532af6be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:39:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Add explicit exact-probe policy for passive intake

Healthy indefinite listeners were repeatedly awakened by finite-wait age and timer backstops, then escalated by same-premise accounting. Opt in only exact task/probe pairs with an explicit external producer and no blocker. Retain age, counts, errors, lost-probe recovery and repeated-fire checks. Policy removal restores ordinary guards and invalidates timer memoization.

Proof: canonical runner passed 212 tests across eight owning suites; scripts/check passed all 20 checks. Pre-publication mutation and split-custody audit still pending; no live opt-in deployed.
